{"seq":1,"slug":"curbside-arrival-geofence-checkin-model","title":"到店地理围栏与签到模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bopis-curbside-pickup-store-fulfillment-orchestration/curbside-handoff-geofence/curbside-arrival-geofence-checkin-model","wordCount":3042,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"到店地理围栏与签到模型\">到店地理围栏与签到模型</h1><p>路边取车最大的体验断点不在拣货，而在「顾客已经站在车旁，系统却还没开始动作」。检测过早，店员会抱着货等一个还在停车场绕圈的顾客；检测过晚，顾客会盯着「等待送达」的屏幕怀疑订单被遗忘。本文讨论把这个时间差压到最低的工程模型：<strong>地理围栏（geofence）负责「可能到了」，签到（check-in）负责「确认到了」</strong>——两者职责与可信度不同，绝不可混为一谈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>到店检测是一条从「设备位置信号」到「门店履约动作」的流水线，每一环都引入延迟与不确定性。工程上要做的不是消除误差（GPS 做不到），而是<strong>把误差暴露成显式的置信度与状态</strong>，让下游据此决定动作强度。</p>\n<p>四个概念必须分开建模：**到达（arrival）**是设备进入门店辐射范围的事实，是概率信号，由平台自动产生、顾客无感知；<strong>签到（check-in）<strong>是顾客</strong>声明</strong>「我已在此车位上、准备取货」，是契约信号，必须可幂等、可追溯；**驻留（dwell）**是顾客在围栏内持续停留超过阈值，用于过滤「路过」与「穿行」；**派单（dispatch）**是门店侧的真实动作，只在置信度达到门槛时才消耗人力。各类检测信号的能力差异，决定了它们必须组合使用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n<th>典型精度/延迟</th>\n<th>可否独立驱动派单</th>\n<th>主要缺陷</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地理围栏 ENTER</td>\n<td>平台自动</td>\n<td>半径 100–150 m 起；延迟约 2–3 分钟</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>高速路过、邻居停车场误触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理围栏 DWELL</td>\n<td>平台自动 + 驻留阈值</td>\n<td>阈值按分钟配置</td>\n<td>条件可用</td>\n<td>阈值过长会让顾客干等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动签到</td>\n<td>顾客点击/扫码</td>\n<td>即时、语义明确</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>依赖顾客配合，有漏签率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓝牙信标/超宽带</td>\n<td>硬件</td>\n<td>可达 1 m 级</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>需门店部署硬件，成本高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键结论：<strong>纯地理围栏不能作为派单的唯一依据</strong>。Android 官方文档指出，围栏进入/退出事件通常延迟 2 分钟以内，但在 Android 8.0+ 后台位置限制下平均约 2–3 分钟，设备静止时可达 6 分钟（来源：Android Developers <em>Create and monitor geofences</em>）。对「顾客已在车旁」这种秒级场景，模型必须另给一条<strong>显式签到</strong>的快速通道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"围栏几何与半径选择\">围栏几何与半径选择</h2><p>围栏半径不是「越大越稳」或「越小越准」的简单取舍，而是一次<strong>漏检与误检的平衡</strong>：半径太小，设备定位误差会让顾客明明到了却不触发；半径太大，隔壁车道的顾客也会被算作到达。设围栏半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>fence</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{fence}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fence</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、设备本次定位的报告精度半径为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>acc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{acc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">acc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则一次可靠判定要求信号点落在围栏内核内，可近似写为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>fence</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>acc</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{eff}} = R_{\\text{fence}} - \\alpha \\cdot r_{\\text{acc}}, \\quad \\alpha \\in [1, 2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fence</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">acc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>acc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{acc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">acc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由定位服务直接给出——Google Geolocation API 的响应就是「经纬度 + 一个表示精度的半径」（来源：Google Maps Platform <em>Geolocation API overview</em>）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是保守系数：Wi-Fi 辅助定位精度约 20–50 m，室内可低至 5 m，无 Wi-Fi 的郊区可达数百米到数公里（来源：Android Developers）。同一半径在市中心与郊区门店表现完全不同，<strong>半径必须按门店点位分级配置</strong>。平台的边界值是硬约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>关键限制</th>\n<th>对模型的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Android</td>\n<td>每应用每用户最多 100 个活跃围栏；建议最小半径 100–150 m</td>\n<td>全国门店若各建多围栏会触顶，需动态注册最近 N 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iOS</td>\n<td>同时最多监视 20 个区域；建议半径 ≥ 约 100 m</td>\n<td>上限更紧，必须动态切换监视对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Radar（第三方）</td>\n<td>圆形围栏半径 10–10,000 m；多边形 4–2,000 坐标；不限数量</td>\n<td>可绕开平台上限，代价是引入服务依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>iOS 的 20 区域上限是设计上的分水岭：常见做法是维护顾客的粗粒度位置，只对最近的门店动态注册监视（Apple Developer <em>Monitoring the user&#39;s proximity to geographic regions</em>）。GPS 漂移同样必须处理：设备静止时定位点会小幅跳动，导致边界处反复产生进入/退出事件。解法是<strong>缓冲区（buffer）</strong>——进入缓冲更积极判定「已进入」，退出缓冲更保守判定「已离开」。等价的本地实现是<strong>迟滞（hysteresis）</strong>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R + b_{\\text{in}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为进入线、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R - b_{\\text{out}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为退出线，两线之间维持上一状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"签到触发与驻留判定\">签到触发与驻留判定</h2><p>手动签到的价值在于它把「我到了」这个语义从<strong>推断</strong>变成<strong>声明</strong>。一个可用的签到表单只需三项：取车位编号、车辆描述、领取人姓名——共同解决「店员在正确的地方找到正确的人」这一最后一米问题。顾客点下「我已到店，停在 12 号位」的瞬间，门店就获得了无需等待围栏延迟的权威信号。但手动签到有漏签率，必须让围栏自动检测兜底，核心是<strong>驻留判定</strong>：仅仅「进入」不足以证明顾客要来取货——顾客可能只是开车路过，或在隔壁停车场停车去别处。平台解法有两层：<strong>驻留事件</strong>（Android 用 <code>GEOFENCE_TRANSITION_DWELL</code> 配合 <code>setLoiteringDelay(ms)</code>，只有停留超过指定时长才触发），以及<strong>停止检测（stop detection）</strong>（Radar 等第三方支持「仅在围栏内停车时才产生进入事件」）。</p>\n<p>驻留阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>dwell</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{dwell}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dwell</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是直接可调的业务旋钮：误报率随它上升而下降，顾客感知等待随它上升而上升。若取车位到门口步行加装货约需 90 秒，合理起点是让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>dwell</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{dwell}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dwell</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖车辆停稳时间（约 30–60 秒），而非让顾客等满十分钟。Radar 的 <code>dwellThreshold</code> 以<strong>分钟</strong>为单位，事件在阈值后的第一个定位点上触发——精度天然到分钟级，秒级场景仍需手动签到补充。另有一层延迟来自<strong>通知响应性</strong>：Android 的 <code>setNotificationResponsiveness(ms)</code> 值越大越省电但告警越迟，官方示例中设为 5 分钟意味着约每五分钟检查一次（来源：Android Developers）。正确做法不是把响应性调到最激进，而是<strong>承认自动检测的延迟下限，用手动签到覆盖延迟敏感的那一段</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多信号融合与置信度分级\">多信号融合与置信度分级</h2><p>把围栏、驻留、手动签到、信标放在一起，模型输出不应是布尔值「到了/没到」，而应是<strong>分级置信度</strong>。Radar 的做法可直接借鉴：每个地理围栏事件带 1–3 的置信度，完全在围栏内为高、大部分在内为中、仅部分在内为低（来源：Radar <em>Geofences</em> 文档）。叠加手动签到后得到派单策略表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>置信度来源</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>门店动作</th>\n<th>产能占用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手动签到（高）</td>\n<td>顾客声明在指定车位</td>\n<td>立即派单，店员出货到车位</td>\n<td>占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>驻留 + 停车检测（中高）</td>\n<td>设备在围栏内停稳</td>\n<td>预派单，备货推到门口待命</td>\n<td>半占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅 ENTER（中）</td>\n<td>设备进入范围，可能路过</td>\n<td>提醒店员准备，不派单</td>\n<td>不占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低置信度/部分覆盖（低）</td>\n<td>位置模糊</td>\n<td>仅记录，等待更多信号</td>\n<td>不占用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>融合规则里的<strong>去抖</strong>是必须的：服务端应对同一顾客的连续事件做聚合，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个连续定位点都落在围栏内才升级置信度，避免边界抖动导致店员被反复派单又撤回。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>升级为高置信</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>point</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mtext>fence</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{升级为高置信} \\iff \\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\mathbb{1}[\\text{point}_i \\in \\text{fence}] = k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">升级为高置信</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">point</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fence</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>更稳妥的做法是<strong>按时间窗而非点数定义</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，例如「最近 90 秒内全部定位点都在围栏内核内」。信标与超宽带（UWB）是精度上限的解药，第三方方案宣称硬件微围栏可把精度做到 1 米以内（来源：Radar <em>Geofencing</em> 概览），但需门店部署硬件，通常只作加分项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等-状态机与异常处置\">幂等、状态机与异常处置</h2><p>顾客在停车场来回挪车、App 重连、推送重发，都会产生重复的到达事件。没有幂等，一次到店可能触发多次派单。幂等的锚点是<strong>业务键</strong>而非事件 ID：对「同一门店 + 同一顾客 + 同一取车会话」，重复的到达事件只应推进一次状态，重复的签到只应更新车位信息而不重复派单。做法是给每个取车会话分配会话 ID 作为分区键，并显式定义「同一状态下的重复事件 = 空操作」。到店会话的状态机至少覆盖这些转移：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[待取货 READY] --&gt;|围栏 ENTER| B[已到达待确认]&#10;  A --&gt;|手动签到| C[已签到待派单]&#10;  B --&gt;|驻留超阈值| C&#10;  B --&gt;|离开围栏 EXIT| A&#10;  C --&gt;|店员接单| D[出货中]&#10;  D --&gt;|交付完成| E[已交付 PICKED_UP]&#10;  D --&gt;|超时未交付| F[升级/主管介入]&#10;  C --&gt;|超时未签到确认| G[转人工电话核实]&#10;  E --&gt; H[归档]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[待取货 READY] --&gt;|围栏 ENTER| B[已到达待确认]\n  A --&gt;|手动签到| C[已签到待派单]\n  B --&gt;|驻留超阈值| C\n  B --&gt;|离开围栏 EXIT| A\n  C --&gt;|店员接单| D[出货中]\n  D --&gt;|交付完成| E[已交付 PICKED_UP]\n  D --&gt;|超时未交付| F[升级/主管介入]\n  C --&gt;|超时未签到确认| G[转人工电话核实]\n  E --&gt; H[归档]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>几类必须显式处理的异常：<strong>误到达</strong>（顾客路过触发 ENTER 随后 EXIT，状态机必须支持从「已到达待确认」回退到「待取货」，而不是把误报永久留在队列里）；<strong>漏签到的超时</strong>（顾客到了但没签到、围栏又因漂移没触发，订单会一直停在 READY，需要一条时长超时把会话升级为人工核实）；<strong>重复签到与车位变更</strong>（挪车后重新签到应更新车位号并保留历史供店员定位，而不是产生第二个派单）。</p>\n<p>另有一个易被忽略的边界语义缺陷：如果应用在顾客已位于围栏内时才开始监视，系统不会产生进入事件，必须主动查询当前状态（iOS 的 <code>requestState(for:)</code>、Android 的 <code>INITIAL_TRIGGER_DWELL</code>）才能得到正确初值（来源：Apple Developer、Android Developers）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"位置隐私与最小化\">位置隐私与最小化</h2><p>到店检测处理的是精确位置——最敏感的个人数据类别之一。门店并不需要顾客的移动轨迹，只需「是否在某车位上」这一判断，因此必须遵守<strong>最小化</strong>：围栏判定在设备端完成，服务端只接收布尔结果而非原始经纬度流；会话结束后停止采集与清理；位置只用于本次履约交付，不得用于营销画像或第三方共享——FTC 已就敏感位置数据的出售与共享采取执法行动（来源：FTC 关于位置数据经纪的执法与政策立场）；权限请求必须说明用途且默认不采集。把「无配置即私有」作为默认，意味着<strong>手动签到是基线能力，自动检测是增强能力</strong>：即使顾客拒绝位置权限，流程依然完整可用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>职责分工是：<strong>围栏负责「可能到了」，签到负责「确认到了」</strong>；前者是概率信号，后者是契约信号，不可互相替代。</li>\n<li>平台围栏有硬性延迟与上限：Android 事件延迟约 2–3 分钟、静止时最多 6 分钟、每应用 100 个围栏；iOS 最多同时监视 20 个区域——因此<strong>必须动态注册最近门店的围栏</strong>。</li>\n<li>半径选择是漏检与误检的平衡，且<strong>依赖设备报告精度半径</strong>（Google Geolocation API 直接返回该值），必须按门店点位分级配置。</li>\n<li><strong>驻留阈值与停车检测</strong>用于过滤路过车辆；阈值以分钟级配置，秒级场景靠手动签到补足。</li>\n<li>输出应是<strong>分级置信度</strong>（高/中/低），门店按级别决定派单、预派单还是仅提醒。</li>\n<li>幂等的锚点是<strong>取车会话 ID + 状态机</strong>：重复到达只推进一次状态，误到达要能回退，漏签到要有超时升级路径。</li>\n<li>位置隐私遵循最小化：<strong>设备端判定、布尔结果回传、会话结束即停采</strong>，默认路径即隐私路径。</li>\n<li>上游依赖库存与可承诺准确性（见 <a href=\"../store-promise-availability/store-inventory-accuracy-visibility-model\">门店库存准确性与可见性模型</a>），下游与拣货备货时序强耦合（见 <a href=\"../store-picking-packing/pick-task-wave-batching-model\">拣货任务生成与波次批次模型</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"到店地理围栏与签到模型","id":"到店地理围栏与签到模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"围栏几何与半径选择","id":"围栏几何与半径选择"},{"level":2,"text":"签到触发与驻留判定","id":"签到触发与驻留判定"},{"level":2,"text":"多信号融合与置信度分级","id":"多信号融合与置信度分级"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等、状态机与异常处置","id":"幂等-状态机与异常处置"},{"level":2,"text":"位置隐私与最小化","id":"位置隐私与最小化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"缺货替代与拣货异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bopis-curbside-pickup-store-fulfillment-orchestration/store-picking-packing/substitution-out-of-stock-pick-exception"},"next":{"title":"交付身份核验与取车排队调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bopis-curbside-pickup-store-fulfillment-orchestration/curbside-handoff-geofence/handoff-identity-verification-queue-dispatch"}}